    ],
    note:
      "Timelines and revisions are agreed before work begins. The first-year domain is included up to a value of 800 UAH.",
    ctaEyebrow: "NORYVIO / YOUR NEXT STEP",
    ctaTitle: "Ready to discuss your website?",
    ctaDescription:
      "Send an enquiry. We'll understand your goals first, then suggest a solution and clear terms.",
